<title>CANADA: Groupe Videotron redeems 1st pfd shares.</title>
<headline>Groupe Videotron redeems 1st pfd shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Videotron Ltee said on Monday it has redeemed the balance of all of its outstanding first preferred shares, series C and series D, for C$140 million.</p>
<p>The move follows the closing of the sale of its indirect interests in U.K. unit Videotron Holdings Plc and is in accordance with the articles of the company, Videotron said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
